<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conviction-armor</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conviction Armor</ansi> spell encases the target in a shell of solidified
belief, providing meaningful protection against incoming attacks. The
armor of pure conviction holds against blows that would pierce mundane
defenses.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast conviction-armor [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Enhancement
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 6
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 50
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Defensive armor buff — bolsters mitigation for a time

